  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now by truth table we get,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Now from above truth table we can say that there are total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;triplet are possible.</p>",
